title: "Millena Miranda Franco - Curriculum Vitae and Portfolio"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the curriculum vitae, academic publications, editorial work,
  technical productions, and software projects of Millena Miranda Franco. It serves as
  a consolidated digital record of contributions in research, teaching, digital humanities,
  and open-source tools developed for archival science and education.
